<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.200" end="00:00:07.400" style="s2">5 years ago, for love, I got into a huge fight <br />with my father and gave up my billiondoll  </p>
<p begin="00:00:07.400" end="00:00:12.400" style="s2">inheritance from the Ross Group. All so I could <br />help Eric build his company from behind the  </p>
<p begin="00:00:12.400" end="00:00:17.900" style="s2">scenes. Now Winston Group is about to go public <br />and our wedding is just around the corner.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.700" end="00:00:31.900" style="s2">Eric, what are you two doing? What are you yelling <br />about? Selena took a liking to this wedding dress,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:31.900" end="00:00:37.300" style="s2">so I let her try it on. What&#39;s the problem? Try <br />it on. That&#39;s my wedding dress. I spent 3 months  </p>
<p begin="00:00:37.300" end="00:00:42.300" style="s2">designing it myself. Every detail by hand. It <br />embodies the 5 years we spent together. Selena,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:42.300" end="00:00:49.200" style="s2">take it off right now. Oh, don&#39;t be <br />so stingy. This dress isn&#39;t even that  </p>
<p begin="00:00:49.200" end="00:00:53.400" style="s2">well-designed. Honestly, I don&#39;t think <br />it&#39;s good enough for Eric&#39;s status now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.800" end="00:01:00.700" style="s2">Shut up. You don&#39;t deserve <br />to wear it. Take it off.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.600" end="00:01:07.100" style="s2">Since you&#39;re so attached to it, <br />I&#39;ll just give it back to you. No.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:08.600" end="00:01:15.500" style="s2">Have you lost your mind? Security, get this crazy <br />woman out of here and cancel all her credit cards.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.600" end="00:01:26.000" style="s2">Eric, I gave you 5 years of my life and <br />you&#39;re doing this to me for her. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.200" end="00:01:33.600" style="s2">Giving. Don&#39;t make it sound so noble. If it <br />weren&#39;t for Winston Group, you&#39;d never have  </p>
<p begin="00:01:33.600" end="00:01:40.200" style="s2">gotten a foot in the door of high society. You <br />should be thanking me. You hear that, Wendy?  </p>
<p begin="00:01:40.200" end="00:01:44.700" style="s2">That time and talent you&#39;re so proud for. It&#39;s <br />worth less to us than those scraps on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.500" end="00:01:51.000" style="s2">Throw her out. Don&#39;t let her bother Selena.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.200" end="00:02:06.293" style="s2">5 years of my life. I was such <br />a fool. You&#39;ll regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.193" end="00:02:13.293" style="s2">Sarah, water. Get me some water.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.493" end="00:02:22.293" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. Mr. Winston said no one is allowed <br />in your room tonight. He said it&#39;s because  </p>
<p begin="00:02:22.293" end="00:02:25.993" style="s2">he&#39;s afraid you&#39;ll have another episode and <br />scare the guests downstairs. I&#39;m running a  </p>
<p begin="00:02:25.993" end="00:02:30.893" style="s2">high fever and he won&#39;t even let anyone bring <br />me medicine. I&#39;m sorry. Those are the orders.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.093" end="00:02:42.393" style="s2">Eric, I&#39;m burning up with fever. Can <br />someone bring me something to reduce  </p>
<p begin="00:02:42.393" end="00:02:46.393" style="s2">my fever? It&#39;s just a little cold. <br />Selena&#39;s throwing a party tonight.  </p>
<p begin="00:02:46.393" end="00:02:50.693" style="s2">If anything goes wrong, can you afford <br />the consequences? I really feel awful.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.393" end="00:03:01.893" style="s2">Eric, this is my home. What gives <br />you the right to throw a party here?</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.793" end="00:03:06.793" style="s2">Get back upstairs. Stop making a scene.  </p>
<p begin="00:03:08.693" end="00:03:12.593" style="s2">Don&#39;t be mad, Eric. She&#39;s probably still <br />upset about the dress from yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.393" end="00:03:21.593" style="s2">Wendy, I was wrong yesterday. To make it up <br />to you, I prepared a special gift for you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.493" end="00:03:29.493" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.493" end="00:03:33.093" style="s2">That&#39;s the necklace my mother left <br />me. Where did you dig that up?  </p>
<p begin="00:03:35.793" end="00:03:42.293" style="s2">Oh, so it was your mother&#39;s keepsake. [laughter] <br />I thought it was just some worthless old junk.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.693" end="00:03:51.293" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.093" end="00:03:59.593" style="s2">Well, look at you on your knees picking up trash.  </p>
<p begin="00:03:59.593" end="00:04:02.494" style="s2">You&#39;re pretty good at it. I heard <br />she used to be a financial genius.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.794" end="00:04:10.894" style="s2">Everyone, I&#39;m sorry to have to announce this. <br />My fianceé Wendy has been diagnosed by a  </p>
<p begin="00:04:10.894" end="00:04:15.594" style="s2">Vancouver psychiatric expert paranel with severe <br />schizophrenia and mania. For her safety to she&#39;ll  </p>
<p begin="00:04:15.594" end="00:04:21.394" style="s2">be at Matric hospital for treatment tonight. Oh my <br />god, a lunatic showing up at a party. What if she  </p>
<p begin="00:04:21.394" end="00:04:26.494" style="s2">hurts me? So she&#39;s mentally ill. No wonder Eric <br />keeps her upstairs. Imagine if she had an episode.  </p>
<p begin="00:04:28.694" end="00:04:31.694" style="s2">I&#39;m not sick. Don&#39;t believe him. Any of you</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.094" end="00:04:37.394" style="s2">get away from me. Don&#39;t touch me, you lunatic.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.394" end="00:04:53.494" style="s2">Eric, that 30% stake you hold in Winston Group, <br />if you don&#39;t sign it over, I&#39;ll never get my  </p>
<p begin="00:04:53.494" end="00:04:58.094" style="s2">hands on it. Starve you for a few days. And <br />once you can&#39;t take it anymore, you&#39;ll sign  </p>
<p begin="00:04:58.094" end="00:05:05.094" style="s2">like a good girl. Once the wedding&#39;s done, <br />you&#39;ll be my wife. Then your money, your body,  </p>
<p begin="00:05:05.094" end="00:05:10.194" style="s2">all of it will be mine. And then you can rot in <br />that mental hospital for the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.194" end="00:05:15.894" style="s2">Take her away. Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.194" end="00:05:24.294" style="s2">Let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.094" end="00:05:34.494" style="s2">Relax. New arrivals always scream for 3 days. <br />What gives you the right to lock me up? I want  </p>
<p begin="00:05:34.494" end="00:05:39.594" style="s2">to make a phone call. I want to see a lawyer. You <br />are in here now, so just behave yourself. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.094" end="00:05:46.094" style="s2">Eric, just you wait. I will make you regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.894" end="00:05:52.994" style="s2">You really sent her in,</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.994" end="00:06:06.595" style="s2">Mrs. Ross. So, did you sleep <br />well? You don&#39;t need to look  </p>
<p begin="00:06:06.596" end="00:06:10.696" style="s2">at me like that. I am just doing my job. <br />Mr. Winston sent me to make you an offer.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.696" end="00:06:21.396" style="s2">It&#39;s simple. Sign this document. Play <br />along at the wedding. And once it&#39;s signed,  </p>
<p begin="00:06:21.396" end="00:06:28.696" style="s2">you can walk out today. And if I don&#39;t sign, <br />don&#39;t sign. Then you stay here. You got a  </p>
<p begin="00:06:28.696" end="00:06:34.896" style="s2">taste of how things work here last night. <br />Needles, restraints, no food. After 3 days,  </p>
<p begin="00:06:34.896" end="00:06:38.996" style="s2">even the strongest person would break. Why do <br />you think Eric sent you here? He can&#39;t get his  </p>
<p begin="00:06:38.996" end="00:06:44.696" style="s2">hands on that 30% stake in Winston Group, and <br />it&#39;s keeping him up at night. Once you sign  </p>
<p begin="00:06:44.696" end="00:06:49.396" style="s2">and the wedding&#39;s done, he&#39;ll be your husband by <br />law. Then everything in your name belongs to him.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.496" end="00:06:57.796" style="s2">Think it over. I&#39;ll give you 24 hours. <br />If you don&#39;t sign within 24 hours,  </p>
<p begin="00:06:58.396" end="00:06:59.696" style="s2">then we keep the injections going.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.696" end="00:07:09.096" style="s2">24 hours. They should be here by now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.496" end="00:07:32.896" style="s2">Mr. Brown, to get Miss Ross out, perhaps we should <br />go through legal channels. How long would legal  </p>
<p begin="00:07:32.896" end="00:07:39.596" style="s2">channels take? 3 days? 3 weeks? You&#39;d let her <br />suffer that long before we get her out? Follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.596" end="00:07:51.196" style="s2">Hey, what are you doing? This is private property.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.996" end="00:07:57.196" style="s2">Seal this place off and find Mrs. Ross fast.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.696" end="00:08:07.397" style="s2">You What are you doing? This is a <br />private psychiatric hospital. You kid.  </p>
<p begin="00:08:09.197" end="00:08:11.897" style="s2">Where&#39;s Wendy? Room 307.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.497" end="00:08:22.897" style="s2">The key.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.597" end="00:08:36.497" style="s2">Who hit her? Doesn&#39;t matter. What <br />matters is that I&#39;ll make him pay. Good.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.397" end="00:08:45.397" style="s2">[panting]  </p>
<p begin="00:08:45.397" end="00:08:47.397" style="s2">You can&#39;t do this. I&#39;ll call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.397" end="00:08:54.097" style="s2">Director, you&#39;ll be hearing <br />from the Ross group&#39;s lawyers.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.697" end="00:08:58.297" style="s2">What kind of force have I crossed?</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.997" end="00:09:04.197" style="s2">Miss Ross, these are your father&#39;s will and the  </p>
<p begin="00:09:04.197" end="00:09:08.097" style="s2">Ross Group trust fund documents. Once <br />you sign, they take effect immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.397" end="00:09:16.997" style="s2">Did he say anything before he passed?  </p>
<p begin="00:09:17.597" end="00:09:21.997" style="s2">He was at peace. He was waiting for <br />you to come back. Once you sign,  </p>
<p begin="00:09:21.997" end="00:09:26.897" style="s2">you&#39;ll be the sole person in control of the Ross <br />Group with a fortune worth hundreds of billions.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.297" end="00:09:33.697" style="s2">From now on, you are the sole <br />person in control of the Ross Group.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.197" end="00:09:42.197" style="s2">What do you plan to do next?  </p>
<p begin="00:09:43.597" end="00:09:50.197" style="s2">Eric wants a wedding, doesn&#39;t he? Fine, I&#39;ll <br />play along. He thought locking me up meant  </p>
<p begin="00:09:50.197" end="00:09:55.097" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t do anything, didn&#39;t he? Take me <br />to his overseas asset management division.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:55.097" end="00:10:00.197" style="s2">Eric is going to pay dearly for everything <br />he&#39;s done. And this is only the beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.297" end="00:10:13.698" style="s2">Eric, you thought locking me <br />up would solve everything.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.298" end="00:10:24.098" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, who are you looking for? <br />We&#39;re closed for the day. I&#39;m the  </p>
<p begin="00:10:24.098" end="00:10:27.298" style="s2">vice president of this company. Do I need a pass?</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.698" end="00:10:48.598" style="s2">Eric, I built this system for <br />you line by line back then.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.098" end="00:10:55.798" style="s2">You changed the password and <br />thought I couldn&#39;t get in.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.698" end="00:11:11.198" style="s2">money laundering chains, shell companies, forged <br />signatures. Eric, not only did you launder money  </p>
<p begin="00:11:11.998" end="00:11:19.198" style="s2">for 5 years, you even forged my signature, <br />trying to pin it all on me. Eric, you want  </p>
<p begin="00:11:19.198" end="00:11:25.498" style="s2">to play dirty games? Then I&#39;ll play along. I&#39;ll <br />use this evidence to completely destroy you all.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.898" end="00:11:36.698" style="s2">This is the evidence I gathered. <br />I think it will be useful to you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.798" end="00:11:45.898" style="s2">Once the wedding is over and she has signed, <br />I will take over all her assets as her spouse.  </p>
<p begin="00:11:45.898" end="00:11:49.698" style="s2">Then I will let her have an episode at <br />the psychiatric hospital and die there.  </p>
<p begin="00:11:50.798" end="00:11:53.698" style="s2">You are ruthless. She is the fool <br />who thought I [music] loved her.  </p>
<p begin="00:11:56.298" end="00:12:01.298" style="s2">At tomorrow&#39;s wedding, I will make him regret <br />everything he has done in front of everyone. Lane,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:01.898" end="00:12:05.498" style="s2">get the media and lawyers set up behind the <br />garden ahead of time, ready to move in at any  </p>
<p begin="00:12:05.498" end="00:12:10.598" style="s2">moment. Then notify all the lawyers to prepare the <br />charging documents for tomorrow. Money laundering,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:10.598" end="00:12:14.499" style="s2">forged signatures, false imprisonment. <br />Not a single charge gets left out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.900" end="00:12:26.100" style="s2">Wendy, the wedding is at 3 this afternoon. You <br />had better cooperate and not cause me any trouble.  </p>
<p begin="00:12:27.900" end="00:12:29.900" style="s2">At this point, you are still afraid I will run.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.800" end="00:12:37.800" style="s2">You had better behave. Everything you <br />signed in there, if I am not satisfied,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:37.800" end="00:12:42.500" style="s2">I can make you have another episode anytime. I <br />have plenty of ways at that psychiatric hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.000" end="00:12:48.400" style="s2">Fine, I will be there.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.200" end="00:12:57.000" style="s2">That is more like it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.700" end="00:13:08.800" style="s2">Lane, is the media here? Good. Have them <br />wait behind the garden until I give the word.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.600" end="00:13:22.100" style="s2">She spent three days suffering in there and <br />signed. What kind of trouble can she still  </p>
<p begin="00:13:22.100" end="00:13:27.200" style="s2">stir up? Once the ceremony is over, that 30% <br />stake in her name gets transferred directly  </p>
<p begin="00:13:27.200" end="00:13:31.700" style="s2">to me. Then let us just wait and watch <br />her walk right into our trap. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.200" end="00:13:50.200" style="s2">She She&#39;s wearing black to her <br />own wedding. Figures. She&#39;s crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.600" end="00:14:00.000" style="s2">Wendy, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.900" end="00:14:08.900" style="s2">Wendy, what do you think you&#39;re doing? <br />Are you trying to ruin Eric&#39;s wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.300" end="00:14:17.901" style="s2">That&#39;s right. This wedding is the <br />beginning of the Winston family&#39;s downfall.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:19.601" end="00:14:25.501" style="s2">What did you say? Say that again. You old <br />fool. I said this is the beginning of the  </p>
<p begin="00:14:25.501" end="00:14:29.301" style="s2">Winston family&#39;s downfall. Someone <br />get this crazy woman out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.001" end="00:14:37.001" style="s2">There&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="00:14:37.001" end="00:14:41.901" style="s2">clearly no class at all. who wears <br />black to her own wedding. What a bad  </p>
<p begin="00:14:41.901" end="00:14:45.301" style="s2">omen. So unlucky. I even wore a new dress today.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:45.301" end="00:14:49.601" style="s2">With that kind of upbringing, she&#39;s <br />hardly worthy of the Winston family name.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.301" end="00:14:56.401" style="s2">Mr. Winston, whether something&#39;s cursed or not  </p>
<p begin="00:14:56.401" end="00:14:59.201" style="s2">isn&#39;t about the color of clothes. <br />It&#39;s about what&#39;s in the heart.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.501" end="00:15:05.501" style="s2">[snorts]  </p>
<p begin="00:15:05.501" end="00:15:07.301" style="s2">You really went all out. Where&#39;d you learn that?</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.901" end="00:15:20.201" style="s2">Oh my Wendy, dear. Did you turn your own wedding <br />into a funeral? Though it&#39;s just as well. Her  </p>
<p begin="00:15:20.201" end="00:15:29.401" style="s2">time as the fiance ends today anyway. Might as <br />well say she&#39;s being buried early. A funeral. I  </p>
<p begin="00:15:29.401" end="00:15:36.401" style="s2">can&#39;t wait. Today I&#39;ll watch with my own eyes as <br />certain people&#39;s dignity gets buried in the dirt.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.801" end="00:15:43.701" style="s2">Wendy, if you just get through the wedding <br />today, I can let go of all that craziness  </p>
<p begin="00:15:43.701" end="00:15:48.901" style="s2">from before. At least save face for both of <br />us. Don&#39;t make things too ugly. [laughter]  </p>
<p begin="00:15:49.601" end="00:15:52.601" style="s2">Let it go, Eric. What right <br />do you have to say that to me?</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.601" end="00:16:01.001" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget, it was the Winston family that gave <br />you everything you have today. Gave you your stage  </p>
<p begin="00:16:01.001" end="00:16:06.501" style="s2">on Wall Street. Without the Winston&#39;s, you&#39;re <br />nothing. You should be grateful. not standing  </p>
<p begin="00:16:06.501" end="00:16:14.101" style="s2">against me. Then let me ask you, Eric, over <br />these five years, Winston Group went from  </p>
<p begin="00:16:14.101" end="00:16:20.602" style="s2">a second rate company to a name that matters <br />on Wall Street. And whose doing was that? Was  </p>
<p begin="00:16:20.603" end="00:16:26.503" style="s2">it that little inheritance your ancestors left <br />you? Or was it me pulling all hours for 5 years,  </p>
<p begin="00:16:26.503" end="00:16:31.403" style="s2">building models, and writing out every single <br />proposal? And you dare talk to me like that?  </p>
<p begin="00:16:33.703" end="00:16:37.903" style="s2">Is what she&#39;s saying true? No wonder. I <br />always wondered where Eric got all those  </p>
<p begin="00:16:37.903" end="00:16:42.103" style="s2">impressive projects. That little bit you gave <br />Eric already paid you back in cash long ago? What  </p>
<p begin="00:16:42.103" end="00:16:46.203" style="s2">more do you want? A thank you certificate. <br />Paid back in cash. Then let me ask you,  </p>
<p begin="00:16:46.203" end="00:16:50.103" style="s2">who built Winston Group&#39;s core financial risk <br />control model with their own hands? Who wrote  </p>
<p begin="00:16:50.103" end="00:16:54.103" style="s2">every single external investment proposal <br />and merger strategy over these 5 years,  </p>
<p begin="00:16:54.103" end="00:17:02.203" style="s2">word by word? Eric, can you even name a single key <br />figure in any of those proposals? No way. So all  </p>
<p begin="00:17:02.203" end="00:17:06.903" style="s2">those big projects these years were actually her <br />work. So Eric&#39;s been mooching off her all along.</p>
