<p begin="01:16:16.142" end="01:16:21.142" style="s2">This is all you. If you had not egged me on over <br />the phone, would I have hired someone to kill her?  </p>
<p begin="01:16:21.142" end="01:16:27.442" style="s2">You pushed me into the fire. I told you to think <br />of a solution. Thinking of a solution does not  </p>
<p begin="01:16:27.442" end="01:16:33.542" style="s2">mean killing someone. I am an old man lying in <br />the ICU. What evil intentions could I have? You  </p>
<p begin="01:16:33.542" end="01:16:40.142" style="s2">twisted it all on your own. And you, Selena, <br />you took the money. You are the mastermind.  </p>
<p begin="01:16:40.142" end="01:16:45.742" style="s2">You gave me the account key. You are the one who <br />said she had to disappear. I was just running your  </p>
<p begin="01:16:45.742" end="01:16:51.442" style="s2">errands. And now you want to dump it all on me <br />alone. If you were not greedy, you would have  </p>
<p begin="01:16:51.442" end="01:16:56.442" style="s2">taken the money and hired someone like you were <br />told. Why would you think of running off with  </p>
<p begin="01:16:56.442" end="01:17:01.542" style="s2">it? You wanted to ditch me and leave me to take <br />all the blame. I see it now. [music] You never  </p>
<p begin="01:17:01.542" end="01:17:06.042" style="s2">intended to actually hire anyone to kill her. <br />You just wanted to swindle me out of my money.  </p>
<p begin="01:17:07.742" end="01:17:13.842" style="s2">You have the nerve to blame me. You and your <br />father, both more selfish than the other.  </p>
<p begin="01:17:13.842" end="01:17:18.242" style="s2">When it comes down to it, you both just <br />want to push the blame onto someone else.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.242" end="01:17:27.742" style="s2">Order. No physical alterations are permitted in <br />this court. One more time and you will be charged  </p>
<p begin="01:17:27.742" end="01:17:34.642" style="s2">with contempt of court. Selena Walker for fraud, <br />aiding moneyaundering, and attempted murder for  </p>
<p begin="01:17:34.642" end="01:17:39.543" style="s2">heft. With multiple offenses combined, you are <br />sentenced to 10 years in prison with all assets  </p>
<p begin="01:17:39.543" end="01:17:46.143" style="s2">confiscated. [gasps] Sir and Winston and Eric <br />Winston, for money laundering, patent theft, and  </p>
<p begin="01:17:46.143" end="01:17:50.943" style="s2">attempted murder for heft with multiple offenses <br />combined. You are sentenced to 25 years in prison  </p>
<p begin="01:17:50.943" end="01:17:54.943" style="s2">without parole, and all assets under your names <br />are to be surrendered in accordance with the law.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.543" end="01:18:02.543" style="s2">[snorts]  </p>
<p begin="01:18:02.543" end="01:18:07.143" style="s2">Wendy, I was wrong. I know I was wrong. We <br />were together for 5 years. Do you really have  </p>
<p begin="01:18:07.143" end="01:18:12.143" style="s2">no feelings left at all? For the sake of what we <br />had, please put in a word for me. I don&#39;t want  </p>
<p begin="01:18:12.143" end="01:18:19.843" style="s2">to spend my whole life in prison. I&#39;m only in my <br />[screaming] 30s. What am I supposed to do? Wendy,  </p>
<p begin="01:18:20.843" end="01:18:25.443" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t too bad to you back then, was I? <br />Just show some mercy and leave me a way out.  </p>
<p begin="01:18:27.343" end="01:18:31.143" style="s2">Wendy, spare me. I don&#39;t want anything <br />anymore. Not my status. Not even this  </p>
<p begin="01:18:31.143" end="01:18:35.743" style="s2">life. I&#39;ll be your servant. Wait on you hand <br />and foot. Please just pretend I never existed.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.943" end="01:18:55.843" style="s2">Wendy, you are just leaving like that. Won&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="01:18:55.843" end="01:18:59.543" style="s2">you even leave me a single word? <br />Won&#39;t you even look at me once?</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.143" end="01:19:13.543" style="s2">It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.743" end="01:19:17.243" style="s2">It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.343" end="01:19:22.743" style="s2">But some things, even when <br />they&#39;re over, won&#39;t come back.  </p>
<p begin="01:19:24.343" end="01:19:29.843" style="s2">Then look ahead. After all, a company <br />this big still needs a leader. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.343" end="01:19:42.644" style="s2">President Ross, the latest financial report is <br />out. The Ross Group&#39;s market value hit another  </p>
<p begin="01:19:42.645" end="01:19:45.245" style="s2">record high this quarter and has officially <br />entered the top 10 multi- channel financial  </p>
<p begin="01:19:45.245" end="01:19:48.045" style="s2">groups in the world. Forbes reporters <br />are already lining up for interviews.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.445" end="01:19:56.845" style="s2">Good work. Tell everyone their year end <br />bodie stays the same plus an extra 10%.  </p>
<p begin="01:19:58.145" end="01:20:02.845" style="s2">Really? I&#39;ll arrange it right away. <br />Clear my schedule for this afternoon.  </p>
<p begin="01:20:04.545" end="01:20:09.645" style="s2">Where are you going? To the prison. <br />I&#39;ll have the car ready for you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.345" end="01:20:33.045" style="s2">Wendy. Wendy, you came. You&#39;re here to save me,  </p>
<p begin="01:20:33.045" end="01:20:35.345" style="s2">aren&#39;t you? You still have <br />feelings for me, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.245" end="01:20:44.145" style="s2">Wendy, I know I was wrong. I really do. You&#39;re <br />so powerful out there. One word and I could get  </p>
<p begin="01:20:44.145" end="01:20:50.345" style="s2">out. Let&#39;s start over. Okay, I&#39;ll be your servant. <br />Eric, I didn&#39;t come here today to save you. I came  </p>
<p begin="01:20:50.345" end="01:20:54.645" style="s2">to tell you three things. First, Winston Group <br />is gone for good. All its assets liquidated,  </p>
<p begin="01:20:54.645" end="01:20:57.545" style="s2">and your convictions won&#39;t be overturned. <br />Second, Selena, the money you made off with  </p>
<p begin="01:20:57.545" end="01:21:00.745" style="s2">back then has been fully recovered <br />and donated to a foundation. Third,</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.145" end="01:21:12.145" style="s2">I came to finally let it all go. Let go? Can you <br />really let go? After all those years between us, I  </p>
<p begin="01:21:12.145" end="01:21:17.645" style="s2">gave you my sincerity and I gave you chances. But <br />you treated my sincerity as a joke and my chances  </p>
<p begin="01:21:17.645" end="01:21:26.745" style="s2">as a stepping stone. Eric, love isn&#39;t infinite. <br />You used it all out. I&#39;m sorry. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.546" end="01:21:50.346" style="s2">Dad, mom, it&#39;s all over. I&#39;ve paid back every <br />debt that needed paying. What you left me,  </p>
<p begin="01:21:50.346" end="01:21:55.146" style="s2">I never squandered a single bit. I <br />made it bigger than it was. Eric,  </p>
<p begin="01:21:55.146" end="01:22:01.846" style="s2">Selena, Saurin, each of them got exactly <br />what they deserved. Sometimes I wonder if  </p>
<p begin="01:22:01.846" end="01:22:06.646" style="s2">I hadn&#39;t been so foolish back then. hadn&#39;t run <br />away from home for a man who wasn&#39;t worth it,  </p>
<p begin="01:22:07.946" end="01:22:12.046" style="s2">would everything have turned out differently? <br />But then again, if I hadn&#39;t taken that path,  </p>
<p begin="01:22:13.246" end="01:22:15.946" style="s2">I might never have seen clearly <br />what&#39;s truly worth holding on to.</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.246" end="01:22:33.146" style="s2">Here again, just came to see them. Nothing <br />special. just wanted to talk to them.  </p>
<p begin="01:22:34.646" end="01:22:35.246" style="s2">What did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.246" end="01:22:46.146" style="s2">I said it&#39;s all over and also said some people <br />are already paying the price for what they did.</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.946" end="01:22:57.446" style="s2">Tell me, if I hadn&#39;t gone soft <br />and run away from home back then,  </p>
<p begin="01:22:57.446" end="01:22:59.946" style="s2">if I then maybe the Ross group <br />wouldn&#39;t be where it is today.</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.146" end="01:23:06.146" style="s2">That&#39;s true. Then I guess all <br />that suffering wasn&#39;t for nothing.  </p>
<p begin="01:23:08.046" end="01:23:11.246" style="s2">Wendy, from now on, I&#39;ll walk this road with you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.146" end="01:23:18.346" style="s2">This is my empire, built with my own hands.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
